sharefinder for Debian
----------------------

Vendored modules

  The Go modules sharefinder depends on are vendored into the orig tarball:
  several of them (go-smb and the forks of gokrb5 and gofork it uses, golog,
  mstypes, ndr) are not packaged in Debian. Build the orig tarball of version
  X.Y.Z with:

    git clone --branch vX.Y.Z https://github.com/vflame6/sharefinder.git sharefinder-X.Y.Z
    cd sharefinder-X.Y.Z
    go mod vendor
    cd ..
    tar --exclude-vcs -czf sharefinder_X.Y.Z.orig.tar.gz sharefinder-X.Y.Z

  debian/rules builds with GOFLAGS=-mod=vendor and GOTOOLCHAIN=local, so only
  the vendored sources and the packaged Go toolchain are used. go.mod
  requires Go 1.26 or later.

Embedded files

  The HTML report embeds scanner/vendor.html (Bootstrap, Bootstrap Icons,
  jQuery and DataTables, minified, all MIT) and scanner/report_head.html and
  scanner/report_tail.html, so DH_GOLANG_INSTALL_ALL copies every file into
  the build tree.

Tests

  The test suite starts SMB servers on 127.0.0.1 and dials reserved
  addresses (192.0.2.0/24, 203.0.113.0/24) that must not answer.

